sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    title Feature: Danger Mode (Hazard Detection)

    actor Blind User
    participant Cam as Camera Sensor
    participant AI as Object Detection
    participant Safety as Safety Module
    participant Audio as Feedback Service

    Note over Cam, Audio: System is scanning in background...

    loop Every 200ms
        Cam->>AI: Send Live Frame
        AI->>Safety: Result: [Label: "Stairs", Confidence: 95%]
        
        opt Hazard Detected
            Safety->>Safety: Check Hazard Level (High)
            
            %% The Critical Interrupt
            Safety-->>Audio: INTERRUPT: Play "Stairs Alert"
            
            par Immediate Feedback
                Audio->>Blind User: "Warning! Stairs Ahead!"
                Audio->>Blind User: [Strong Continuous Vibration]
            end
        end
    end
